iers","lil'mukadhibīna"]],"77:41":[["Indeed","inna"],["the righteous","l-mutaqīna"],["(will be) in","fī"],["shades","ẓilālin"],["and springs","waʿuyūnin"]],"77:42":[["And fruits","wafawākiha"],["from what","mimmā"],["they desire","yashtahūna"]],"77:43":[["Eat","kulū"],["and drink","wa-ish'rabū"],["(in) satisfaction","hanīan"],["for what","bimā"],["you used to","kuntum"],["do","taʿmalūna"]],"77:44":[["Indeed, We","innā"],["thus","kadhālika"],["reward","najzī"],["the good-doers","l-muḥ'sinīna"]],"77:45":[["Woe","waylun"],["that Day","yawma-idhin"],["to the deniers","lil'mukadhibīna"]],"77:46":[["Eat","kulū"],["and enjoy yourselves","watamattaʿū"],["a little","qalīlan"],["indeed, you","innakum"],["(are) criminals","muj'rimūna"]],"77:47":[["Woe","waylun"],["that Day","yawma-idhin"],["to the deniers","lil'mukadhibīna"]],"77:48":[["And when","wa-idhā"],["it is said","qīla"],["to them","lahumu"],["Bow","ir'kaʿū"],["not","lā"],["they bow","yarkaʿūna"]],"77:49":[["Woe","waylun"],["that Day","yawma-idhin"],["to the deniers","lil'mukadhibīna"]],"77:50":[["Then in what","fabi-ayyi"],["statement","ḥadīthin"],["after it","baʿdahu"],["will they believe","yu'minūna"]]}